# Privy app id for the email/Google login (embedded Stellar wallet).
# Create an app at https://dashboard.privy.io, enable Stellar under
# "Embedded wallets", add this site's origin to the allowed domains, and
# paste the App ID here. While unset, the email option in the login chooser
# is shown as "Soon" and doesn't open Privy.
#
# PUBLIC_ vars are inlined by Vite at BUILD time. On Cloudflare Workers
# Builds set it as a build variable, not a runtime secret.
PUBLIC_PRIVY_APP_ID=
